{"id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","title":"Transitive Closure","display":"df-transitive-closure — Transitive Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-transitive-closure","aliases":["58-df-transitive-closure","58-df-zfc-canonical-transitive-closure"],"display":"df-transitive-closure — Transitive Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-transitive-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-transitive-closure</span><span>58-df-zfc-canonical-transitive-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transitive-closure — Transitive Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,T\\in V\">\\(X,T\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TC}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{(n)},\n\\qquad\nX^{(0)}=X,\\quad X^{(n+1)}=\\bigcup X^{(n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TC}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{(n)},\n\\qquad\nX^{(0)}=X,\\quad X^{(n+1)}=\\bigcup X^{(n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}canonical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(T,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\mathrm{TC}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}canonical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(T,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\mathrm{TC}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}least}\\vdash\nT=\\mathrm{TC}(X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\nX\\subseteq T,\\quad\\forall y\\in T\\;(y\\subseteq T),\\\\\n\\forall Y\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(X\\subseteq Y\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(y\\subseteq Y)\\to T\\subseteq Y\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}least}\\vdash\nT=\\mathrm{TC}(X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\nX\\subseteq T,\\quad\\forall y\\in T\\;(y\\subseteq T),\\\\\n\\forall Y\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(X\\subseteq Y\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(y\\subseteq Y)\\to T\\subseteq Y\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}(X)\\)</span> is the least transitive set containing every element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The minimality clause is set-bounded and does not take an unexplained intersection over a proper class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TC}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{(n)},\n\\qquad\nX^{(0)}=X,\\quad X^{(n+1)}=\\bigcup X^{(n)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}canonical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(T,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\mathrm{TC}(X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}least}\\vdash\nT=\\mathrm{TC}(X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\nX\\subseteq T,\\quad\\forall y\\in T\\;(y\\subseteq T),\\\\\n\\forall Y\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(X\\subseteq Y\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(y\\subseteq Y)\\to T\\subseteq Y\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1274,"backlinks":[{"id":"2b067c38223ce186","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TC}$ (transitive-closure operator, see [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]])"},{"id":"ea81b884c63a4fa0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TC}$ (transitive-closure operator, see [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]])"},{"id":"e6cca9bbf44b6255","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]